## Origin

2026-08-08 — operator hard rule stating the product's global objective: provide
every resource, workflow, and attestation a regulated organization and its
workforce needs, with the evidence gathered through the product's own online
systems. Written down because prior work repeatedly stopped at the resource
layer and recorded the requirement as addressed, and because "customer-owned"
had been accepted as a reason to ship nothing rather than a statement about who
renders the verdict.
